# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — OHOS 静态 glib 双实例 GObject 类型系统冲突:消费者 unref 库内 GObject 崩溃 ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-09-16
# Software: libxmlb 0.3.19(任何在静态 glib 环境下交付 .so 的库及其消费者)
# Gate: test_package / 消费者运行时
# Status: UNMATCHED — needs human/AI review to promote to E-entry

id:                     E2229
title: OHOS 静态 glib(shared=False)嵌入 .so 时消费者形成双实例 GObject 类型系统,unref 库内对象 SIGSEGV
trigger_tool: test_package / consumer runtime
phase: runtime
error_signature: Signal 11 \(core dumped\)|g_object_unref.*SIGSEGV|G_IS_FILE.*incompatible|assertion 'G_IS_FILE\(file\)' failed|xb_builder_source_load_file.*G_IS_FILE
severity:               2
category:               ohos, runtime, glib, gobject
match_keywords: static glib, shared=False, GObject, type system, double instance, SIGSEGV,
  g_object_unref, G_IS_FILE, libxmlb, consumer test, test_package, embedded glib
root_cause: glib/2.88.0 制品为静态库(shared=False)时,libxmlb.so 在链接期把 glib/gio 静态嵌入自身
  (libxmlb.so NEEDED 仅 libzstd/libc,无 libglib-2.0 等);消费者二进制另行静态链接同一 glib 时,
  进程内存在两份独立 GObject 类型系统,库内对象类型 ID 与消费者侧 G_IS_FILE/g_object_unref
  期望不一致,跨边界类型检查失败或 double-free 触发 SIGSEGV
affected_scope: OHOS + 静态 glib 环境下所有 glib 依赖库的消费者与 test_package 编写;
  未来 glib 提供 shared 制品后边界收窄
verification_cmd: nm -D libxmlb.so.2.0.0 | grep -c " U g_".*(0 = glib 被静态嵌入);
  probe: g_ptr_array_unref(results) 后 g_object_unref(silo) 触发 Signal 11;
  不 unref(进程退出)则 exit 0
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: skip-cross-library-unref
rec_description: 消费者测试不 unref 库内 GObject/GPtrArray(进程退出回收),只释放自有分配
rec_command: (测试源码 out 段仅 g_free 自有字符串 + g_error_free,不 g_ptr_array_unref/g_object_unref)
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: 测试编写规范
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: 依赖 shared glib
fallback_description: 让 glib 构建 shared=True 变体并从制品仓提供,消除静态嵌入(长期方案)
fallback_command: (依赖方/平台侧改造)
fallback_auto_fix: false
fallback_impl: 平台侧
principles:               
conflicts_with:
prerequisite_of:
doc_file: knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-libxmlb-static-glib-double-instance.md
last_updated: 2026-09-16
source_event: libxmlb 0.3.19 消费者测试 unref silo SIGSEGV(exit 139),probe 二分定位
authors: pc2-20
